1
00:00:00,710 --> 00:00:02,710
(Sheldon-bot :)Leonard, my door.

2
00:00:02,710 --> 00:00:03,950
(Leonard:)What about it?

3
00:00:03,950 --> 00:00:06,760
(Sheldon-bot :)Be a lamb and open it for me.

4
00:00:06,770 --> 00:00:08,720
(Leonard:)Why? What's the problem?

5
00:00:14,610 --> 00:00:17,540
(Sheldon-bot :)You think you have me stymied,
don't you?

6
00:00:17,540 --> 00:00:21,010
(Leonard:)No, I think a doorknob
has you stymied.

7
00:00:22,510 --> 00:00:25,570
(Howard:)Oh, look, it's Leonard
and R2-D-Bag.

8
00:00:27,350 --> 00:00:29,070
(Raj:)That's my joke.
I told it last night.

9
00:00:29,070 --> 00:00:31,360
(Raj:)You can't just use it.

10
00:00:31,360 --> 00:00:34,740
(Sheldon-bot :)Raj, be a lamb
and open the door for me.

11
00:00:34,740 --> 00:00:37,330
(Raj:)Oh, sure.

12
00:00:39,580 --> 00:00:41,120
(Sheldon-bot :)He's a lamb.

13
00:00:41,120 --> 00:00:42,920
(Sheldon:)You're not.

14
00:00:45,340 --> 00:00:47,540
(Raj:)I'm a lamb.

15
00:00:49,740 --> 00:00:51,640
(Sheldon-bot :)Isn't this nice?

16
00:00:51,640 --> 00:00:54,880
(Sheldon-bot :)The pleasures of fellowship
and camaraderie

17
00:00:54,880 --> 00:00:59,050
(Sheldon-bot :)without having to tolerate
your germy breath on my skin.

